see "../src/rng.vox".
see "../src/gen_literals.vox".
see "../src/gen_manifest.vox".
see "../src/gen_core.vox".
see "../src/gen_buffers.vox".
see "../src/gen_files.vox".
see "../src/gen_collections.vox".
see "../src/gen_text.vox".
see "../src/gen_things.vox".
see "../src/gen_flow.vox".
see "../src/gen_misc.vox".

(Things (part B), batch A - docs/ledger/things-b.md rows THG2-06,
 THG2-08, THG2-09, THG2-10, THG2-21, THG2-27, THG2-30, THG2-32, THG2-70.

 Every leaf here reads the manifest (gen_pick_thing/gen_pick_field, or
 this batch's own gen_thing_function_*/gen_thing_predicate_* pair), so each
 group below builds one with 'gen build manifest' at a fixed seed before
 calling the leaf directly and printing 'gen text' - the golden is the
 leaf's own rendered output, the same convention tests/300 uses for the
 buffer leaves.

 Seed 1 draws a manifest with both a plain thing and a nested one
 (things=5, both queries true - checked by hand against this seed
 before pinning it), so every leaf below has something to fire on. Seed
 4 draws zero things, which is what proves the fix below: without it,
 'gen thing function ready' stayed true from whatever the PREVIOUS program in
 the same process last set it, because 'gen build thing functions' -
 the only place that used to reset it - is never reached when a program
 has no things at all. Seed 1 immediately before seed 4 in one process
 is exactly the shape that broke.)

To 'gen things b setup' with a number called seed.
    'rng seed' of seed.
    Set gen_does_file_io to false.
    'gen build manifest'.
    'gen build thing predicate function'.
    'gen build thing functions'.

Print "--- THG2-06: a whole thing interpolates into a format string ---".
'gen things b setup' of 1.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing format whole' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'gen things b setup' of 1.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing format whole' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG2-08, THG2-09: is / is not between two things ---".
'gen things b setup' of 1.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing equality' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG2-10: the comparison recurses into a nested field ---".
'gen things b setup' of 1.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing nested equality' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG2-21: an ordinary global function taking a thing, both call forms ---".
'gen things b setup' of 1.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing free function' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG2-27: of / to / with / on all introduce arguments ---".
'gen things b setup' of 1.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing call prepositions' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG2-30: the receiver fills the first parameter, the rest follow the preposition ---".
'gen things b setup' of 1.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing extra argument' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG2-32: a receiver reached through a field reads the same way ---".
'gen things b setup' of 1.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing field receiver' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG2-70: is a <type> recognises the six builtins ---".
'gen things b setup' of 1.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing type predicate' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'gen things b setup' of 1.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing type predicate' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- a program with no things at all: every gen_thing_fn_*-dependent leaf stands aside ---".
'gen things b setup' of 4.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing free function' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the reset fix: seed 1 (has things) run immediately before seed 4 (has none) in one process ---".
'gen things b setup' of 1.
'gen things b setup' of 4.
Print "thing fn ready after a things-free program: {gen_thing_function_ready}".
Print "nested-receiver ready after a things-free program: {gen_thing_function_nested_ready}".
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing call prepositions' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG2-70's predicate function stays available even with zero things ---".
Print "predicate ready with no things: {gen_thing_predicate_ready}".
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing type predicate' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.
